Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:47.17,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Team 3 to deck 4 damage control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful energy readings...\NDirectly overhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid, Commander Shultz...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we'll be able to hold our heads high before General Goer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If that man hears this, he'll report to\NLord Dessler, as if he'd done it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However... This is our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilun Phezeron.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A message from Shultz for our lord. He wishes to give a report to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shultz?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave him command of the Plat base, in the galactic hinterlands' Zol system.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes... I left a brigade of second-class Gamilans
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,in charge of the planet Teron's conquest, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Valke Shultz, commander of the armies besieging Teron, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shultz, you are contacting us without your commanding officer, Goer's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.29,0:03:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, this act would be grounds for{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now. Let him speak, Hiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your report, Shultz?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, at Tam 10:06 Gamilas Standard Time, after fierce combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the Plat advance base destroyed the\NTeron FTL-capable spaceship Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... I wanted to report our victory to you directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.41,0:04:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You requested my presence merely to report something so obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wished to provide some small additional glory
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,for the Great Gamilas Empire's founding celebration...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall remember your loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Be off, Shultz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Garle Dessler! Hail to our leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Celestra, is it true that a Teron ship crossed the light-speed barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Vice-Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, neither have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I would imagine not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, what did Lord Dessler say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he would remember our loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish Terons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Had they simply surrendered,\Nthey could have lived on, as we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,SID, overlay Alpha Squad's zone of operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Executing command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've linked geographic data with the heat sources projected to be the Gamilas base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Balance control, are those vents closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boatswain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck wants to drown in a spaceship? Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How are those extractor pumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're closing this area! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we have it stopped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This wound's nothing. Just put some spit on it, and it'll heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Makoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Harada is seeing patients elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong! I'll patch you up right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,First-aid complete here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did the enemy attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know how!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished the check. No problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yama, how long will we have to sit at the bottom of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We still aren't out of the solar system. Will we really make it to Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never allow another of my ships to sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the moment I left Earth,\Nmy life's been in old man Okita's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do what we can. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. A beam weapon that uses satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The large amount of debris made me curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I had the intelligence officer scan it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't debris. These are all enemy satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe they've been using the satellites as beam weapon relays. In other words...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They can target the entirety of Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, if we surface, they'll just hit us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we find the timing they use to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that explosive camouflage fooled them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, we wait and believe in Kodai and the other pilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the time is right, the Yamato will strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nemoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That Yamamoto rookie's a real babe, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,EM restrictions in effect. Communication not sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, Navi-baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Command not recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Loosen up a little, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.09,0:08:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Command not recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,3,000 kilometers until target reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,EM restrictions lifted. Sugiyama, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugiyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo 3 is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we chose a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:08:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Teron fighters? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Above the 137th Unmanned Environmental Modification Plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Environmental Plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The AA System is engaging them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears there are several others hiding as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably survivors from the Yamato. Launch the interceptors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Bravo 1. EM restrictions lifted. I've found the Gamilas base!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Yamamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Two o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Two o'clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from Bravo 1, Kato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He has engaged target object 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's their base?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Coordinates confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But we aren't sure it's the enemy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's uncertain, you can't win some wars without placing a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons Officer, load missiles. Prepare to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing to launch missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine Officer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine on line. We can reach max speed whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Boatswain, how are the Wave Motion Shields?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've done what we can. Inertial control is also on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can fight with our feet on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, all crew. This is the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We now move to undersea operations, to counterattack the Gamilans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew to combat station 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the engine running!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Spin the trim. Blow the main tank.\NRaise bow thirty-five degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy came from within the auroras. Meaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning! Warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensors are indicating an unreadable energy emission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning! Warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it. This is definitely the enemy base!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:12:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Signal on radar. Enemy fighters above base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible! What happened to the concealment field?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's functioning properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Remain calm, Ganz. Ship-borne planes are nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct hit on concealment system. Field dissipating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Concealment field lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something surfacing at location where the Yamato sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell? That's the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do? We've already given our report to Lord Dessler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire Reflecting Satellite Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing to fire Reflecting Satellite Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Select relay satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Selecting relay satellites...\N6, 33, 28, 57...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's irrelevant. We'll simply sink it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our report was merely a bit early... Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.95,0:13:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin our attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo 1, withdraw from the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo 1, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Alpha 1, Kodai. Requesting backup from the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 1 has discovered the camouflaged enemy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the equipment on board, it will prove difficult to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the real base?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see anything that resembles a beam launcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably hidden below the surface or in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is the biggest threat to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, Yamamoto are to stay in the area, to confirm location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirm it? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,See with your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... Your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it! This wasn't the right base?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The cavalry's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinohara! Nemoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They look like a bunch of thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploying reflectors 6, 33.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the satellite signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Beginning analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now deploying 28, 57.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Relay satellites identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Target locked. AA interceptor missiles ready for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire AA interceptor missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time, you survived. But you won't survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy charge complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Reflecting Satellite Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 2, Yamamoto, to Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've identified the enemy cannon. Location is a frozen bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. Transmit data now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire. We'll destroy the enemy cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,57 is lost. It's been shot down from the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the Yamato noticed the satellite cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare cannon to fire again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, we'll change angles,\Nfiring from outside their effective range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Level the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Inertial control working properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Space gyros reversed. Dropping starboard ballast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Level!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship leveled. All inspections reported no problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Type-3 rounds set with timed fuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Target is the enemy beam cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Load main gun with Type-3 rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ranging complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.51,0:17:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Countdown to impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,10.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,9.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,8.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.52,0:17:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,7.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,6.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,5.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,4.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the Reflecting Satellite Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Alpha 1. Destruction of enemy beam cannon confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now move to destroy the enemy base.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise bow twenty degrees. Launch the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.06,0:18:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No signal from the Reflecting Satellite Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato approaching rapidly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, it's too dangerous here. Please evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you survive, you have\Nthe chance to restore our honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ranging complete. Targeting complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Air-to-surface missiles ready to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Four enemy ships are leaving the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We will pursue. Switch main guns to shock cannon mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We will protect you. Please, be safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to switch to Geschtam Navigation! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy is charging toward us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Destoria has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Geschtam Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy has warped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gamilas advance base on Pluto is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No more planet bombs will fall to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Returning to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Plat has fallen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiss, was I dreaming? Did the Teron ship not sink?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. I was given the same information.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shultz abandoned his base, to retreat from the front lines, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Retreat" is not a word in the Gamilas dictionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory... If not victory, death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Terons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato has left Pluto's orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We will return to our original course. Set engines to combat speed 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Course adjusted. Engines at combat speed 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With different emotions in each of their hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the crew of the Yamato now leave the solar system behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.12,0:24:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Before them lies a galaxy no human has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.50,0:24:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Say a prayer for those who set sail,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.66,0:24:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and a goodbye to those left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.38,0:24:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let your feelings be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We will return!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Farewell to the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 355 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:32.21,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\fade(500,900)}{\pos(960,1035)}Planet Gamilas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:37.17,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\fade(500,900)}{\pos(960,1035)}Capital City Baleras
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:43.18,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\fade(500,900)}{\pos(960,1035)}Lord Dessler's Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:29.49,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1700,2600)}{\pos(1390,840)}Episode 6
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:29.49,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1700,2600)}{\pos(1260,1073)}The Sun Sets on Pluto
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:23:00.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The unknown calls to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.46,0:23:12.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Does your courage burn to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:15.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}We rush on a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:18.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}For everyone to survive together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:22.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}For happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:27.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Though there is pain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:35.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}We will not be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:40.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Those who know the beautiful Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:45.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Restore its wonders
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.53,0:23:49.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bring it back, bring it back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:52.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The road to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:56.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not afraid anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:24:03.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Determined to reach our destination
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:21.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:28.97,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:36.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:42.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.32,0:00:47.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:52.66,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:59.79,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:08.72,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:24.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
